      {
        title: "DNS records via a public resolver",
        body: "Check A, MX, TXT, and NS records with dig or nslookup against a public resolver, not the target's own DNS server, to keep the lookup passive.",
        diagram: {
          type: "terminal",
          prompt: "$",
