    title: "Burp Intercept: capture login request on DVWA",
    description: `Stand up DVWA locally in Docker, then use Burp's Intercept to catch the raw login POST request before it reaches the server and tamper with its parameters. This teaches the core proxy workflow every later attack (SQLi, XSS, IDOR) relies on: seeing and editing a request before it is sent, rather than trusting whatever the browser's form UI allows.`,
