    moduleId: "m8",
    title: "Burp Intruder: password spray on DVWA",
    description: `Automate a credential-guessing attack against DVWA's login form using Burp Intruder's Sniper mode with a Grep-Match success condition, the same technique used in real engagements to test for weak/reused passwords at scale once manual testing has confirmed the endpoint doesn't lock out or rate-limit.`,
    platform: "Burp Suite / DVWA",
    difficulty: "medium",
    estimatedHours: 2,
