    title: "PortSwigger: SSRF - 2 labs",
    description: `Complete two PortSwigger Web Academy SSRF labs that build from a straightforward internal-endpoint pivot to bypassing weak blacklist-based defenses, developing the skill of turning a server-side URL-fetch feature into a foothold on infrastructure that is otherwise unreachable from the internet.`,
    platform: "PortSwigger",
    difficulty: "medium",
    estimatedHours: 3,
