      `Change the stockApi value to http://localhost/admin to reach the internal-only admin interface, then to http://localhost/admin/delete?username=carlos to delete the target user and solve the lab`,
      `Open the 'SSRF with blacklist-based input filter' lab; submit the same http://localhost/admin payload and observe it gets blocked by the site's blacklist`,
      `Bypass the blacklist by re-encoding the URL: try an alternate IP representation such as http://127.1/admin or a case/URL-encoding trick like http://localhost%2523@127.0.0.1/admin, and use an open redirect if provided to reach the internal host indirectly`,
      `Confirm bypass success by loading the admin panel through the crafted URL, then delete the target user via the exposed endpoint to solve the lab`,
      `For both labs, record the exact stockApi value that worked, since minor formatting differences (trailing slash, port) commonly break the payload`,
