      `Open 'Web shell upload via Content-Type restriction bypass'; upload shell.php and confirm it is blocked because the server checks the request's Content-Type header rather than the actual file`,
      `Resend the same request in Burp Repeater, but change the multipart Content-Type field from application/octet-stream (or similar) to image/jpeg while leaving the PHP payload bytes unchanged`,
