    description: `Complete a price-manipulation lab and a workflow-validation-bypass lab on PortSwigger Web Academy's Business Logic Vulnerabilities path, learning to find flaws that no input filter or WAF will ever catch because the requests themselves are perfectly well-formed -- only the application's trust assumptions are broken.`,
