      `Apply the first coupon, then the second, then re-apply the first again -- confirm the discount stacks further each time rather than being blocked as already-used, because the server only checks the immediately-preceding state rather than tracking total redemptions`,
      `Repeat the toggle-and-reapply sequence until the discounted price is at or below your available credit, complete checkout, and confirm the lab is solved`,
